 Added some more anti exploit stuff\r\n\r\nGive the game a thumbs up! It lets me know you guys want updates ;D","path":"/game/402122991-redwood-prison","slug":"402122991-redwood-prison","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/231e421d9859577ede6a75194c7801b22fcd5e28b1f1ea695f0c0db2cc42a7be.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f25b43b26d8e0ecf18e41f10cfc6f267/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":296066413,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T05:53:23.889Z","creator":{"name":"RoyStanford","type":"User"},"script":{"count":15,"freeCount":15,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":171391948,"name":"[Sides] Vehicle Simulator","desc":"","path":"/game/171391948-vehicle-simulator","slug":"171391948-vehicle-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e77bb2a94951926cd7c9279aadcebea1447b8a2f663d47d4a5e6c8644ea1046d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e2b3484a57548b7ac1bf28a59970a2c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-02T22:15:21.731Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":48994649,"name":"BLOODFEST [Butcher + new map!]","desc":"Take on waves of horrifying zombies, use money earned to upgrade weapons! Features 5 classes to level, each with unique playstyles.\n\n⚠️⚠️⚠️\n4/6/24 (v2.7):\n- Massive update! Butcher, Darkwood map, and new wave system added to the game!\n\n3/23/24 Update (v2.61):\n- VSS, SKS, Thomps., Sten, Ruger Mini-14, Remington 870, and Claymore added!\n- Balance changes to weapons across all classes to help buff the weaker classes and add more interesting purchasing decisions.\n\n3/16/24 Update (v2.6):\n- New procedural animation system for characters for more lifelike movement\n- Reload & melee related bug fixes\n\n3/10/24 Update:\n- Voice customization\n- Flashlight\n⚠️⚠️⚠️","path":"/game/48994649-bloodfest","slug":"48994649-bloodfest","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me